WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.222
Vroom! Vroom!

2
00:00:05.223 --> 00:00:11.750
Eddy zoomed around.

3
00:00:11.751 --> 00:00:15.302
"Way to go, Eddy!" said Jeb.

4
00:00:15.303 --> 00:00:18.671
"You're fast!" said Dipper.

5
00:00:18.672 --> 00:00:22.820
Honk! Honk! Poppy tooted her horn.

6
00:00:22.821 --> 00:00:27.042
Eddy grinned.

7
00:00:27.043 --> 00:00:37.669
"Someday I'll be a race car!" he said.

8
00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:41.052
"No, you won't," said Zippy.

9
00:00:41.053 --> 00:00:47.754
"You're too slow!"

10
00:00:47.755 --> 00:00:53.420
Eddy frowned.

11
00:00:53.421 --> 00:01:01.842
Ms. Fender came outside.

12
00:01:01.843 --> 00:01:04.962
"Good morning!" said the teacher.

13
00:01:04.963 --> 00:01:09.063
"It's time for safety class."

14
00:01:09.064 --> 00:01:12.863
"Safety class?" said Zippy.

15
00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:16.602
"That's boring!"

16
00:01:16.603 --> 00:01:22.105
"Safety is important," said Ms. Fender.

17
00:01:22.106 --> 00:01:27.835
She led everyone to a track.

18
00:01:27.836 --> 00:01:32.053
Eddy saw cones.

19
00:01:32.054 --> 00:01:34.971
He saw stop signs.

20
00:01:34.972 --> 00:01:38.007
He saw traffic lights.

21
00:01:38.008 --> 00:01:42.171
"We'll practice here," said Ms. Fender.

22
00:01:42.172 --> 00:01:45.839
"Everyone will drive on the track.

23
00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:48.338
Don't go too fast."

24
00:01:48.339 --> 00:01:51.544
Zippy laughed.

25
00:01:51.545 --> 00:01:55.439
"This will be easy for Eddy.

26
00:01:55.440 --> 00:02:03.873
He's slow!"

